guide aurum-druid/druid-class-quests
title 16 - Cure Poison and Aquatic Form
faction Alliance
race NightElf
class Druid
levels 16-18
zone Stormwind City
category Class
folder Aurum - Druid and dungeons
version 5
next aurum-druid/ruins-of-lordaeron
reward spell 8946 "Cure Poison"
reward spell 1066 "Aquatic Form"
reward item 15866 16608 263411
why Learn both Druid utility spells with their class-quest rewards before the next dungeon.

# Adapted from Fitz / fitzforge Polestar, GPL-3.0-only.
# Sources: guides/forever/class/druid/cure-poison.guide and aquatic-form.guide
# at 1775eb81e56fc1e127ae869ccec0b7dc8d7092fd.
# Aurum adaptation: combine the Night Elf chains at level 16 and return to
# our dungeon route. Darkshore is visited only for these class quests.

step Class-quest supplies and level
  tip Bring five Earthroot from your bags, the Auction House, or Maria Lumere's limited stock in Stormwind. This supply check completes if you already own five; it does not require buying them again. Keep your hearthstone at Sentinel Hill for the Westfall pendant later. Cure Poison unlocks at 14 and Aquatic Form at 16; this route batches both at 16.
  level 16
  buy 2449 x5 npc 1313

step Reach your Darnassus trainer
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade, then ask Silva Fil'naveth for her free Druid flight to Rut'theran Village and use the portal up to Darnassus. Silva's flight needs no unlock.
  teleport 18960
  fly "Rut'theran Village" npc 11800

step Take both class chains
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker is on the middle level of the Cenarion Enclave tree; climb the interior ramp. Take both quests before teleporting back to Moonglade.
  accept 6121 npc 4217 lvl 14
  accept 26 lvl 16

step Dendrite's two lessons
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade and speak to Dendrite Starblaze upstairs in the Nighthaven building; use the interior ramp.
  teleport 18960
  turnin 6121
  accept 6122
  turnin 26
  accept 29

step Trial of the Lake
  tip Take a Shrine Bauble from a container on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven. Use it at the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore and speak to Tajarri before the bauble expires.
  collect 15877 x1
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4
  complete 29
  turnin 29
  accept 272

step Fly to Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip Ask Silva Fil'naveth for her free flight to Rut'theran Village, then take Vesprystus's regular flight to Auberdine. Both northern objectives can be gathered before returning to town.
  fly "Rut'theran Village" npc 11800
  fly "Auberdine"
  vendor 6737 -- Sell and refill affordable Melon Juice before the north-coast class objectives. Keep both pendant halves and five Earthroot.
  buy 1205 x20 npc 6737 optional

step Cliffspring Falls sample
  tip Follow the northern road toward Cliffspring Falls. Fill the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler at the cave mouth by the falls.
  collect 15845 quest 6122.1

step Northern aquatic pendant
  tip The Strange Lockbox lies underwater off the north coast, west of the Ruins of Mathystra. Watch your breath and keep the pendant half in your bags.
  collect 15883 x1

step Return to Alanndarian
  tip Alanndarian Nightsong waits in Auberdine. Hand over the sample and take Gathering the Cure.
  turnin 6122
  accept 6123

step Prepare the cure
  tip Gather Lunar Fungus from the Lunar Fungal Blooms in the moonkin caves east of Auberdine. Use the five Earthroot you brought from Stormwind; herbalists can gather replacements in Darkshore if needed.
  collect 15851 x12 quest 6123.2
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6123.1

step Collect the animal salve
  turnin 6123
  accept 6124

step Cure the Sickly Deer
  tip Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Deer rather than attacking them. They roam Darkshore between Cliffspring River and the southern border. The objective counter tracks successful cures.
  use 15826 quest 6124.1 @41.5,46.08 -- Target living Sickly Deer in the woods near Auberdine and use the salve; cure ten deer. Do not attack them.

step Westfall pendant
  zone Westfall
  tip Hearth to Sentinel Hill. If the hearthstone is unavailable, take the Auberdine boat to Stormwind and fly to Sentinel Hill. Ride north-west to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor offshore. Keep both pendant halves.
  hearth "Sentinel Hill"
  collect 15882 x1

step Finish both lessons in Moonglade
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Combine the two pendant halves into the Pendant of the Sea Lion near the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, then speak to Dendrite upstairs in the Nighthaven building. Hand in both completed lessons and take both trainer returns.
  teleport 18960
  collect 15885 quest 272.1
  turnin 272
  accept 5061
  turnin 6124
  accept 6125

step Return to Mathrengyl
  tip Ask Silva Fil'naveth for her free flight to Rut'theran Village and use the portal up to Darnassus.
  fly "Rut'theran Village" npc 11800

step Learn Cure Poison and Aquatic Form
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 6125
  turnin 5061 reward 16608 263411

step Back toward the next dungeon
  zone Darkshore
  tip Return through Rut'theran and fly to Auberdine. The next chapter takes the boat toward Menethil and Southshore for Ruins of Lordaeron; do not return to Stormwind first. Keep your hearth bound at Sentinel Hill for the dungeon return. This remains a class-and-dungeon visit, not general Darkshore questing.
  fly "Auberdine"
